   "text": "Airflow DAG alerts_etl\nSCHEDULE: 1st of month, 03:00 UTC\nafter the 00:30 fetch (+ make run)\nextract → validate → transform →\nload → build_features → quality_check\nbatch = previous month (data interval)\ncode: dags/alerts_etl.py → etl/",
