   "text": "MODELS — alias @champion · commit 52cc28c\nM1 kyiv-m1-start-risk v6 — P(start) per hour, 6 h\nM2 kyiv-m2-duration v7 — P50 / P90, monotonic\nM3 threat type — next (needs ingest_telegram)\n(label = alert_level: yellow drones / red missiles)\nfallback: hour-of-day baseline, degraded=true\ncode: training/models.py · features.py",
   "originalText": "MODELS — alias @champion · commit 52cc28c\nM1 kyiv-m1-start-risk v6 — P(start) per hour, 6 h\nM2 kyiv-m2-duration v7 — P50 / P90, monotonic\nM3 threat type — next (needs ingest_telegram)\n(label = alert_level: yellow drones / red missiles)\nfallback: hour-of-day baseline, degraded=true\ncode: training/models.py · features.py",
