   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHEN TO RETRAIN\n• monthly — after alerts_etl of the month passes\n  (expanding window, new version = challenger)\n• early — on a drift / accuracy alarm (design 6.6)\n• two-level regime — first retrain once 2026-11,\n  2026-12, 2027-01 are loaded (≈ Feb 2027)\n• promotion — challenger beats champion on the\n  last 3 monthly folds → manual alias move",
   "originalText": "WHEN TO RETRAIN\n• monthly — after alerts_etl of the month passes\n  (expanding window, new version = challenger)\n• early — on a drift / accuracy alarm (design 6.6)\n• two-level regime — first retrain once 2026-11,\n  2026-12, 2027-01 are loaded (≈ Feb 2027)\n• promotion — challenger beats champion on the\n  last 3 monthly folds → manual alias move",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
