   "text": "STATUS TODAY\nbuilt: alerts_etl, fetch_alerts_in_ua, DVC, MinIO,\nPostgres, MLflow, training,\nchampions M1 v6 + M2 v7 (features v3),\nLab 3 LLM job (corpus, pgvector, Gemini, eval)\ndata: 2022-03 … 2026-08 (official file)\n+ 2026-10 (API, two-level red / yellow regime)\nplanned: poller, forecast_6h, API,\nmonitoring (Lab 4), ingest_telegram + M3 (next)",
   "originalText": "STATUS TODAY\nbuilt: alerts_etl, fetch_alerts_in_ua, DVC, MinIO,\nPostgres, MLflow, training,\nchampions M1 v6 + M2 v7 (features v3),\nLab 3 LLM job (corpus, pgvector, Gemini, eval)\ndata: 2022-03 … 2026-08 (official file)\n+ 2026-10 (API, two-level red / yellow regime)\nplanned: poller, forecast_6h, API,\nmonitoring (Lab 4), ingest_telegram + M3 (next)",
